  "prompt": "What was LedgerLoop's MRR on 30 June 2025, in each currency? MRR comes from subscription_events: a subscription's MRR on a date is the sum of its mrr_delta_local with event_date on or before that date, in its subscriptions.currency. Every event counts, opening events included, because the opening events hold the MRR that existed on 1 January 2024. Return two columns, in this order: currency and mrr_local. Return one row for each currency. Any row order is fine.",
